---
const reasons = [
  {
    title: 'Built for looks, not leads',
    desc: 'Sites that look polished but fail to guide visitors to contact. No clear hierarchy of trust, proof, or next step. Visitors browse and leave—competitors with simpler but clearer sites win the call.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Weak local SEO foundation',
    desc: 'Missing schema, inconsistent NAP, thin location pages, or GBP not aligned with the site. Prospects search locally—if you are invisible in map pack or service searches, you lose before they ever land.',
  },
  {
    title: 'No clear next step',
    desc: 'Buried contact forms, vague CTAs, or multiple competing actions. When intent is high but the path is unclear, friction kills conversions. Every page should answer: what do I do now?',
  },
  {
    title: 'Outdated and neglected',
    desc: 'Stale content, slow load times, security gaps, broken forms. Trust erodes quickly. A neglected site signals a neglected business—and it hurts rankings over time.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section-padding bg-stone-50">
  <div class="content-width">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start">
      <div>
        <h2 class="heading-lg mb-6">Why Most Local Business Websites Don't Convert</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg mb-8">We audit NJ service business sites regularly. The same patterns recur: design without conversion logic, SEO without local intent, and no clear path to inquiry. These are fixable—but they require structural change, not cosmetic tweaks.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-6">
          {reasons.map((r) => (
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1e3a5f]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#1e3a5f]" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">{r.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-stone-600">{r.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <img src="/images/why-most-fail.webp" alt="Professional reviewing website audit and conversion gaps" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-md object-cover aspect-[4/3] max-h-[280px]" width="500" height="375" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 card-elevated">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 mb-2">See exactly where your site falls short</p>
          <p class="text-stone-600 mb-6">We review structure, conversion flow, technical SEO, and local visibility. You get a concrete list of what is broken and what to fix first—no obligation.</p>
          <a href="/contact#audit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-white bg-[#1e3a5f] hover:bg-[#2d4a6f]">Get a Free Website & SEO Audit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
